{"synopsis":"Yong Hwarin, seorang pewaris Klan Tianzhong yang memiliki penyakit, akhirnya menyerah pada jalan seni bela diri dan hidup sebagai pedagang setelah menikah dengan keluarga lain.\n\nMembawa penyesalan hingga saat-saat terakhirnya, secara tak terduga dia melakukan regresi ke masa lalu yang dia pikir tidak akan pernah dia temui lagi...!\n\nKembali ke masa-masa di mana dia berada di titik terendahnya, dia bersmpah dalam hatinya jika takdir baru akan terlahir kembali melalui tangannya sendiri.","alternative_title":"천중용문","author":"Gunju","artist":"Mukji","chapters":[{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"03992cde-a10a-420a-bd29-28d05cc19fa1","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-04-30"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"d102588b-96ee-4166-abe2-3caff8b1c7db","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-04-30"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"d4c9f25a-651f-4ba5-8e83-a6dc8eaeefd5","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-04-23"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"90f410af-561d-4fd5-94d3-c3bd6457d0af","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-04-22"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"e2d1f4bf-b6f8-4a8c-9f03-cb09befef8e3","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-03-24"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"be72bc63-e594-4bd4-915c-ceed2bdbbd15","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-03-16"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"e2da4475-cfae-43f0-9630-3451fbce7ca8","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2026-03-16"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"79a53872-3da9-4c2f-b334-b462c452497a","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2026-02-26"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"16fd056c-cba9-4dab-8884-a56cdb9f5a6f","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2026-02-26"},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"0c97e31f-4d4b-48fd-829f-4906f4445504","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-02-18"},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"f5b8dd7a-89b0-444d-953a-2c2abf01da72","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-02-05"},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"5b1da1a1-9c5b-4b92-a99b-06ac82c048f2","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-02-05"},{"nu